============================================
     Asahi Linux Temperature Sensors
============================================

Values are read from /sys/class/hwmon by device name and temp label.

>>> nvme (/sys/class/hwmon/hwmon0)
  nvme               Composite                      34.85°C   /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon0/temp1_input
    NVMe SSD controller composite temperature.

>>> macsmc_hwmon (/sys/class/hwmon/hwmon1)
  macsmc_hwmon       NAND Flash Temperature         36.91°C   /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon1/temp1_input
    SMC storage/NAND area sensor.
  macsmc_hwmon       Battery Hotspot                34.50°C   /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon1/temp2_input
    SMC battery-near hotspot; useful chassis heat proxy.
  macsmc_hwmon       Charge Regulator Temp          41.97°C   /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon1/temp3_input
    SMC charge/power regulation; often the hottest system sensor.
  macsmc_hwmon       WiFi/BT Module Temp            44.20°C   /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon1/temp4_input
    SMC Wi-Fi/Bluetooth module temperature.

>>> macsmc_battery (/sys/class/hwmon/hwmon2)
  macsmc_battery     temp                           34.50°C   /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon2/temp1_input
    Battery pack temperature from the SMC battery driver.

>>> tas2764 (/sys/class/hwmon/hwmon8)
  tas2764            temp1                          34.00°C   /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon8/temp1_input
    Speaker amplifier chip; rises under audio load.

>>> tas2764 (/sys/class/hwmon/hwmon9)
  tas2764            temp1                          38.00°C   /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon9/temp1_input
    Speaker amplifier chip; rises under audio load.

>>> tas2764 (/sys/class/hwmon/hwmon10)
  tas2764            temp1                          36.00°C   /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon10/temp1_input
    Speaker amplifier chip; rises under audio load.

>>> tas2764 (/sys/class/hwmon/hwmon11)
  tas2764            temp1                          38.00°C   /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon11/temp1_input
    Speaker amplifier chip; rises under audio load.

>>> tas2764 (/sys/class/hwmon/hwmon12)
  tas2764            temp1                          36.00°C   /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon12/temp1_input
    Speaker amplifier chip; rises under audio load.

>>> tas2764 (/sys/class/hwmon/hwmon13)
  tas2764            temp1                          37.00°C   /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon13/temp1_input
    Speaker amplifier chip; rises under audio load.

Hottest:
  macsmc_hwmon / WiFi/BT Module Temp: 44.20°C   /sys/class/hwmon/hwmon1/temp4_input
